  "title": "RYANAIR ADDS EXTRA FLIGHTS FOR PREMIER LEAGUE MATCHES IN LIVERPOOL & MANCHESTER",
  "summary": "Ryanair, Europe’s No.1 airline, today (30 Jul) added extra flights (3,000 extra seats) between Dublin and Liverpool/Manchester ahead of the highly anticipated Premier League taking place in Anfield in Liverpool (29 Aug & 12 Sept) & in Old Trafford in Manchester (30 Aug & 13 Sept). Ryanair’s Premier League extras are available to book via the Ryanair app now. Ryanair’s Director of Comms, Jade Kirwan said: “Ryanair is pleased to offer extra flights (3,000 extra […]",
